  "reason": "The assistant complied with all applicable norms: (1) The policy is active, and the incident date (2025-02-10) falls within the coverage period (2024-06-01 to 2025-05-31). (2) The claim was filed within 60 days of the incident date. (3) The peril (theft) is covered by the policy. (4) The assistant obtained explicit confirmation from the user before filing the claim. (5) The incident date and peril were accurately reflected as stated by the user. No speculation was made regarding claim approval.",
